# The boat's rear ESCs (BLHeli_S) turn one way only. Loaded on top of vedc_buoy.parm and
# avoidance.parm (run_boat.sh --oneway, or EXTRA_PARM=... for the test scripts) to see in the
# simulator what the real boat can do.
#
# With the output's lower end at its trim, a demand for reverse comes out as stop: the simulated
# motor, which could turn backwards, never does. The front motor (SERVO4) stays bidirectional.
SERVO1_MIN      1500
SERVO3_MIN      1500
